OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader backs NUFC training
OL,4,Aground plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has backed #190m plans
OL,7,Ffor Newcastle United's new training
OL,8,Fground but insisted they would be given
OL,9,F"robust" scrutiny.
OL,11,FThe club announced on Thursday a deal
OL,12,Fhad been struck to purchase the
OL,13,F260-acre (105-hectare) Woolsington Hall
OL,14,Festate as the location for a "world
OL,15,Fclass" new training complex.
OL,17,FThe estate houses a listed country
OL,18,Fhouse and parkland and was previously
OL,19,Fpurchased in 1994 by former Newcastle
OL,20,Fchairman Sir John Hall, who had wanted
OL,21,Fto move the club's academy there.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
