OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader backs NUFC training
OL,4,Aground plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewcastle City Council's Liberal
OL,7,FDemocrat leader Colin Ferguson welcomed
OL,8,Fthe prospect of the club moving their
OL,9,Ftraining base within the city's
OL,10,Fboundaries from the existing training
OL,11,Fground in Longbenton.
